    "summary": "Author: A finextra community member",
    "hasSummary": true,
    "link": "https://www.finextra.com/blogposting/33265/when-cybersecurity-takes-a-website-offline-how-ai-can-detect-php-vulnerabilities?utm_medium=rssfinextra&utm_source=finextrafeed",
